WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 011. RECORDS LOOK THE SAME. Similarity is not identity.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
STRUCTURE. WHAT KIND OF THING? Model entities before matching.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
SUPPORT. IDENTIFIER. ATTRIBUTE. RELATIONSHIP. Every signal needs evidence.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CONFLICT. CONTRADICTIONS CAN SPLIT. Never average away authoritative mismatch.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
REVIEW. RATIONALE + ROLLBACK. The score never merges records.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
MINIMIZE. MATCH ONLY WHAT IS NECESSARY. Context determines identity.
